msgstr "Nöömt na den germaanschen Donnergott Thor."

#. i18n: tag scalar
#. i18n: file element_tiny.xml line 184
#: rc.cpp:626
msgid ""
"Greek 'protos' for 'ancester'. Protactinium is before Actinium in the "
